  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an August 2026 post as Chief of the National Guard Bureau, Nordhaus said defense industry partners test AI-driven technologies through Northern Strike to help define tomorrow's battlespace. In a March 2025 statement, Nordhaus described harnessing artificial intelligence for real-time decision-making and turning drones into force multipliers as capabilities for anticipating threats.",
